An opposite-sign exchange and a costed purchase balance, but the journal lacks a default commodity.

========== API ==========

aggregate()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Fund
2024-01-01 Exchange
  Assets:Cash  -100 SEK
  Assets:Fund  2 FUND
2024-01-02 Costed purchase
  Assets:Fund  1 FUND @ 10 SEK
  Assets:Cash  -10 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Cash",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "-110"
  },
  {
    "account": "Assets:Fund",
    "commodity": "FUND",
    "quantity": "3"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========

[MISSING_DEFAULT_COMMODITY] Journal must declare one default commodity
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:1:1
